abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.2.0 is a backward-compatible minor release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It completes the public residue-to-receipt terminology transition by renaming receipt-related parameters; named-argument callers must update while binary compatibility, positional calls, and runtime behavior remain unchanged. It also services dependencies, automation, tests, and documentation. Package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0 remain unchanged."
